{"v":1,"book":"Gen","ch":13,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"And Abram went up out of Egypt, he and his wife and all that he had, and Lot with him, into the Negev.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[1]},{"t":" went "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":" out of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[2]},{"t":", he and his "},{"t":"wife","s":["H0802"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and all that he had, and "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[8]},{"t":" with him, into the Negev."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And Abram was very rich in livestock, in silver and in gold.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[0]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rich","s":["H3513"]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"livestock","s":["H4735"],"a":[3]},{"t":", in "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and in "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And he continued on his journey from the Negev as far as Bethel, to the place where his tent had been at the beginning, between Bethel and Ai,","tok":[{"t":"And he continued on his "},{"t":"journey","s":["H4550"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from the Negev as far as Bethel, to the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[7]},{"t":" where his "},{"t":"tent","s":["H0168"],"a":[11]},{"t":" had "},{"t":"been","s":["H1961"],"a":[9]},{"t":" at the "},{"t":"beginning","s":["H8462"],"a":[12]},{"t":", between Bethel and Ai,"}]},{"n":4,"text":"To the place of the altar, which he had made there formerly; and there Abram called on the name of Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"To the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[2]},{"t":", which he had "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" there formerly; and there "},{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"called","s":["H7121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And Lot, who went with Abram, also had flocks and herds and tents.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[1]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"went","s":["H1980"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"with","s":["H0854"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[4]},{"t":", also had "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H6629"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"herds","s":["H1241"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"tents","s":["H0168"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And the land could not support them that they might dwell together, for their possessions were so great that they could not dwell together.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[3]},{"t":" could not support them that they might "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[5]},{"t":", for their possessions were so "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[9]},{"t":" that they "},{"t":"could","s":["H3201"],"a":[11]},{"t":" not "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And there was strife between the herdsmen of Abram’s livestock and the herdsmen of Lot’s livestock. And at that time the Canaanites and the Perizzites dwelt in the land.","tok":[{"t":"And there was "},{"t":"strife","s":["H7379"],"a":[1]},{"t":" between the herdsmen of "},{"t":"Abram’s","s":["H0087"],"a":[5]},{"t":" livestock and the herdsmen of "},{"t":"Lot’s","s":["H3876"],"a":[9]},{"t":" livestock. And at that time the "},{"t":"Canaanites","s":["H3669"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"Perizzites","s":["H6522"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H3427"],"a":[13]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And Abram said to Lot, Let there please be no strife between me and you and between my herdsmen and your herdsmen, for we are brothers.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Let there please "},{"t":"be","s":["H1961"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"no","s":["H0408"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"strife","s":["H4808"],"a":[7]},{"t":" between me and you and between my herdsmen and your herdsmen, for "},{"t":"we","s":["H0582"],"a":[15]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"brothers","s":["H0251"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Is not the whole land before you? Please separate yourself from me. If you go to the left, then I will go to the right. Or if you go to the right, then I will go to the left.","tok":[{"t":"Is not the whole "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" before "},{"t":"you","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":"? Please separate yourself from me. If you go to the left, then I will go to the "},{"t":"right","s":["H3231"],"a":[9]},{"t":". Or if you go to the right, then I will go to the "},{"t":"left","s":["H8041"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"And Lot lifted up his eyes and saw the entire plain of the Jordan, that it was well watered everywhere — this was before Jehovah had destroyed Sodom and Gomorrah — like the garden of Jehovah, like the land of Egypt, as you go to Zoar.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[1]},{"t":" lifted "},{"t":"up","s":["H5375"],"a":[0]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and saw the entire "},{"t":"plain","s":["H3603"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Jordan","s":["H3383"],"a":[8]},{"t":", that it was well "},{"t":"watered","s":["H4945"],"a":[11]},{"t":" everywhere — this was "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[14]},{"t":" had "},{"t":"destroyed","s":["H7843"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Sodom","s":["H5467"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Gomorrah","s":["H6017"],"a":[18]},{"t":" — like the "},{"t":"garden","s":["H1588"],"a":[19]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[20]},{"t":", like the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[21]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[22]},{"t":", as you go to "},{"t":"Zoar","s":["H6820"],"a":[24]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"So Lot chose for himself the entire plain of the Jordan, and Lot journeyed east; and they separated themselves from each other.","tok":[{"t":"So "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"chose","s":["H0977"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for himself the entire "},{"t":"plain","s":["H3603"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Jordan","s":["H3383"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"journeyed","s":["H5265"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"east","s":["H6924"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; and they separated "},{"t":"themselves","s":["H6504"],"a":[10]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"each","s":["H0376"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"other","s":["H0251"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Abram dwelt in the land of Canaan, and Lot dwelt in the cities of the plain and moved his tent as far as Sodom.","tok":[{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H3427"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Canaan","s":["H3667"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"Lot","s":["H3876"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H3427"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"plain","s":["H3603"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and moved his "},{"t":"tent","s":["H0167"],"a":[8]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"far","s":["H5704"],"a":[9]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"Sodom","s":["H5467"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Now the men of Sodom were very wicked and sinful toward Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Now the "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Sodom","s":["H5467"],"a":[1]},{"t":" were very "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and sinful toward "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And Jehovah said to Abram after Lot had separated from him, Now lift up your eyes, and look from the place where you are, northward and southward and eastward and westward;","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Abram","s":["H0087"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "}